        "title": "Add the fractions",
        "body": "$\\frac17+\\frac13=\\frac{10}{21}$. Adding the decimals digit by digit (the period of $\\frac17$ is $6$ and of $\\frac13$ is $1$, so the sum repeats every $6$ digits): $0.142857\\,142857\\ldots+0.333333\\,333333\\ldots=0.476190\\,476190\\ldots$, with no carries.\n\nThis is $0.\\dot47619\\dot0$.\n\n**Answer: (C)**"
